# Studio

This is Cine-XOX: 3x3 cinephile XOX on Next.js + Capacitor + Supabase. Not Unity.

- Spec: `MASTER_SPECIFICATION_v3.md`. Cell stealing is forbidden.
- Shared engine: `src/core`. UI must not fork win/lock/rarity rules.
- Offline bot stays network-free. No same-phone pass-and-play. The shot clock makes handing the phone absurd.
- Cosmetics only in shop. No pay-to-win.
- No IMDb/TMDb ratings or poster CDNs.
- Leave MatchmakingQueueModal, ShotClock, and XoxBoard structure intact unless the user explicitly asks.
- After engine or data edits: `npm test`. After TS edits: `npx tsc --noEmit`.
- Scope lock: `docs/product/MVP.md`. One slice. No new meta systems.
